---
title: Bulk commodity distribution expands to a new cooperative partner network
category: LAVS Trading
date: 2026-08-15
featured: true
excerpt: A recent commercial milestone in coco net and activated carbon supply for large-scale environmental projects, opening a new channel for producers in Quezon Province.
coverImage: /images/news/bulk-commodity-distribution.jpg
---

LAVS Trading & Development Services Inc. has expanded its bulk commodity distribution network to include a new cooperative partner serving large-scale environmental and infrastructure projects across the region.

The agreement covers coconut-fibre coco nets used in erosion control, along with activated carbon supply for industrial filtration. It's the latest step in a growing pipeline of commercial-volume trade connecting local producers with buyers who need consistent, national-standard supply.

"Distribution, not production, is usually the bottleneck for producers at this scale," said a company representative. "This partnership takes that burden off the cooperative's plate entirely."

The new channel is expected to be fully operational before the end of the year.
